@startuml Sequence - Email Find & Password Reset
skinparam monochrome true
actor User
participant FE
participant Auth
participant CI as PhoneID
participant MTA as Email


User -> FE : Start "이메일 찾기"
FE -> CI : Phone owner verification
CI --> FE : Verified
FE -> Auth : Lookup accounts by phone/identity
Auth --> FE : {emails: [a@x, b@x]}
User -> FE : Select account
FE -> MTA : Send email OTP
MTA --> User : OTP
User -> FE : Verify OTP
FE -> Auth : Issue reset token
Auth --> FE : Reset token
User -> FE : Set new password
FE -> Auth : Update password
Auth --> FE : Success
FE --> User : Re-login
@enduml
